<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n6794" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀνακράζω</span></b> , fut.
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-κράξομαι</span> or fut.
		pf.
		<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b>
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-κεκράξομαι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					LXX
					<u>Jl.</u>
					3(4).16
				</span></i>
			: aor.
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀνέκρᾰγον;</span> late <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀνέκραξα</span> ib.<i><span class="en">
				<u>Jd.</u>
				7.20
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>BGU</u>
				1201.11
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Ev.Marc.</u>
				1.23
			</span></i>, al.:—<i>cry out, lift up the voice, shout,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπεὶ . . ἀνέκραγον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Od.
					14.467
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εἴ τι πέραν ἀερθεὶς
			ἀνέκραγον</span> if I <i>raised my voice</i> too high, <i><span class="en">
				Pi.
				<u>N.</u>
				7.76
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐξ ἑνὸς στόματος ἅπαντες ἀνέκραγον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ar.
					<u>Eq.</u>
					670
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				<u>V.</u>
				1311
			</span></i>, etc.; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οὐκ ἀνέκραγεν,</span> of
			a dying man, <i><span class="en">
				Antipho
				5.44
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πρῶτος ἐπὶ τοῦ βήματος ἀνέκραγεν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Arist.
					<u>Ath.</u>
					28.3
				</span></i>
			: foll. by a relat., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀνέκραγον ὡς εὖ λέγοι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ar.
					<u>Ec.</u>
					431
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				X.
				<u>An.</u>
				5.1.14
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τηλικαῦτ᾽ ἀνεκράγετε,
			ὡς</span> . . <i><span class="en">
				D.
				21.215
			</span></i>: c. inf., <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀνακραγόντων
				βάλλειν</span> . . <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				<u>Phoc.</u>
				34
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> rarely of
			animals, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἂν γλαὺξ ἀνακράγῃ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Men.
					534.11
				</span></i>
			.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
